\subsection{Introducing SDoH Data}
We then wished to explore if introducing SDoH data could allow us to predict outcomes with similar or improved accuracy. We pulled eight indicators that are often linked to health outcomes from the ACS DataTables.
To determine which indicators were statistically significant, we ran ordinary linear regression. Any indicator with a p-value less that $0.1$ was kept. Table 2 is a summary of the original indicators, as well as the regression.
